diff --git a/docs/configuration/miscellaneous.md b/docs/configuration/miscellaneous.md
index bcdf85ca..ca5bf6cc 100644
--- a/docs/configuration/miscellaneous.md
+++ b/docs/configuration/miscellaneous.md
@@ -23,6 +23,12 @@ description: Advanced settings for XWayland, focus behavior, and system integrat
 | `warp_cursor` | `1` | Warp the cursor to the center of the window when focus changes via keyboard. |
 | `cursor_hide_timeout` | `0` | Hide the cursor after `N` seconds of inactivity (`0` to disable). |
 | `cursor_hide_on_keypress` | `0` | Hide the cursor on keypress. |
+| `shake_to_locate` | `1` | Enlarge the cursor temporarily when the mouse is shaken, to help find it (`0` to disable). |
+| `shake_to_locate_sensitivity` | `1.0` | Shake detection sensitivity (`0.1`-`10`). Higher triggers with less movement. |
+| `shake_to_locate_min_distance` | `90` | Pointer travel (px, within 500 ms) needed before a shake can trigger (`10`-`5000`). Divided by the sensitivity. |
+| `shake_to_locate_intensity` | `1.0` | How fast and how large the cursor grows while shaking (`0.1`-`20`). |
+| `shake_to_locate_cooldown` | `1200` | Minimum time (ms) between two activations (`0`-`60000`). |
+| `shake_to_locate_max_size` | `0` | Largest cursor size in pixels (`0` = no configured limit, hard safety cap 4096). |
 | `drag_tile_to_tile` | `0` | Allow dragging a tiled window onto another to swap their positions. |
 | `drag_tile_small` | `1` | Allow dragging a tiled window temporarily to small size.|
 | `drag_corner` | `3` | Corner for drag-to-tile detection (0: none, 1–3: corners, 4: auto-detect). |
